concept:crimes-act-1915-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Section 1"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1.) This Act may be cited as the Crimes Act 1915. (2.) The Crimes Act 1914, as amended by this Act, may be cited as the Crimes Act 1914-1915. (3.) This Act shall continue in force during the continuance of the war and for six months thereafter, and no longer. Short title, citation, and duration." ;
    skos:definition "(1.) This Act may be cited as the Crimes Act 1915. (2.) The Crimes Act 1914, as amended by this Act, may be cited as the Crimes Act 1914-1915. (3.) This Act shall continue in force during the continuance of the war and for six months thereafter, and no longer. Short title, citation, and duration."@en ;
